  o Minor bugfixes (anyone_hosts, security):
    - A signed anyone_hosts file that repeats a header keyword, or has
      keyword or mapping lines after its signature, is now rejected, and
      mappings are read only up to the signature line.  Lines added below
      the signed region of an installed file are no longer used.  A
      mapping whose name begins with "anyone-hosts-signature" no longer
      makes a correctly signed file fail verification.
